  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "CliArgs is the primary command-line interface (CLI) dispatcher for the JARVIS application, acting as the central orchestrator for system initialization and mode routing. It analyzes user arguments to determine if the application should run as a Server (BrainHub), a Client (Agent), or a Standalone mode. It coordinates various services like DirectoryManager and ProgramConfig to bootstrap the correct execution context, managing complex workflows such as tool creation, server startup, and agent session management."
  },
